0..77 Comment "// Deep handlers of one operation, replayed by the kernel: the bridge reads a"
78..152 Comment "// handled body as a program of its effect\'s free model, a `Return` of the"
153..223 Comment "// body\'s value or the operation with its payload and the continuation"
224..290 Comment "// awaiting its reply, and the handler as the fold of that program"
291..366 Comment "// (`tree-exit.gandr` writes the translation by hand). The kernel types the"
367..444 Comment "// program and the fold, so the claim that the body performs only the handled"
445..469 Comment "// operation is its own."
